## Goal and acceptance checks

1. Observable result, proved by `<exact command or test name>`.
2. Failure path, proved by `<exact command or test name>`.

## Tasks

| Id | Task | Status | Owner role | Depends on | Evidence when done |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
